ual", "url": "https://x.com/bb833dong/status/2116146009608749258"}, {"author_id": "1398565994042376195", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:31:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116146007759012189"], "id": "2116146007759012189", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I have a brand-new Bot to share with you today! \n\nI\u2019ve launched Useful Bots, a newsletter where I share practical Grok Bot templates you can copy, customize, and start using immediately.\n\nNo complicated setup. No coding. Just useful tools you can use easily. \n\nSubscribe so you", "url": "https://x.com/karatademada/status/2116146007759012189"}, {"author_id": "1497446442973212675", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:31:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116145975165174084"], "id": "2116145975165174084", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1808720032035450881", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115858468276142156", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thaGrOucHy1One Facts bots are game changer. Actual went live with my Grok Forex Bot. \ud83e\udd16", "url": "https://x.com/Nickmeta/status/2116145975165174084"}, {"author_id": "1852469224691970048", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:31:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116145966336098417"], "id": "2116145966336098417", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116114580975788308", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @volkerhuetter @LeeKing19318432 First time I\u2019ve seen u actually do something you lazy ass bot", "url": "https://x.com/boredatwork23/status/2116145966336098417"}, {"author_id": "26946819", "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:31:23.000Z", "edit_history